<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Celulosa Q3 net loss $18.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Celulosa Q3 net loss $18.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to February 28. Net loss $18.9 million vs loss $26.4 million. Revs $26.8 million vs n/a.  </p>
<p>NOTE: Although pulp and paper company Celulosa Argentina SA provided no comparatives. It said revenue was 11 percent lower than in the third quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>The company did not report EPS.</p>
<p>((-Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-06500))</p>
